id: monster
name: Monster
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Traits and never enforced (the user's). Its Factor Traits are the files
# in the folder of its name, `order:` as its page lists them: Custom Monstrosity 1, Devil 2, Fairy 3, Genie 4, Ghost 5, Goblin 6,
# Mummy 7, Plant Monster 8, Troll 9, Vampire 10 - all Body.
requirement: >
  Earthling or Demon
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: >
  You are not Unnatural before applying the effects of any of Monster's Factor Traits.
description: >
  Whether due to circumstances or lineage, you are a monstrously misunderstood creature. Your preternatural nature creates an uncanny image in the minds of others.
